	(text "AUDIO ARCHITECTURE - MIGRATED FBV2-S1-006\n\nMK1 PUI DMM-4026-B-I2S-R  (REPLACES ICS-43434)\n  LR    -> GND   = LEFT I2S SLOT\n  CONFIG-> GND   = MANDATORY, READ AT POWER-UP\n  VDD 1.62-3.63 V, C8 100nF LOCAL\n  SD TRI-STATES OFF-SLOT -> R120 100k PULL-DOWN\n           (DATA-SHEET REQUIREMENT, NOT A CHOICE)\n  7 PADS, NOT 6. NEW SYMBOL AND NEW FOOTPRINT.\n\nU5 MAX98357AETE+T   3.3 V, PRODUCTION\n  GAIN_SLOT -> VDD = 6 dB   (WAS GND = 12 dB)\n  AT 12 dB A 0 dBFS SAMPLE ASKS FOR 5.07 Vrms\n  AND THE RAIL ONLY GIVES 2.33 Vrms, SO EVERYTHING\n  ABOVE -6.8 dBFS CLIPPED. AT 6 dB 0 dBFS = THE RAIL.\n  SD_MODE: >1.4 V = LEFT, <0.16 V = SHUTDOWN.\n  R15 100k TO GND (SHEET 08) = OFF AT RESET.\n  NO SERIES R ON SD_MODE: VDD AND VDDIO ARE THE\n  SAME +3V3 NET, SO VDD < VDDIO CANNOT HAPPEN.\n\nSHARED I2S: BCLK AND LRCLK COMMON, MIC_DIN AND\nSPK_DOUT SEPARATE. FULL DUPLEX ON ONE CONTROLLER.\n\nBUS RATE IS SET BY THE MICROPHONE, NOT THE AMP:\n  MIC NORMAL MODE NEEDS BCLK 2.048-4.096 MHz.\n  16 kHz x 64 = 1.024 MHz IS OUT OF THAT RANGE.\n  RUN 48 kHz x 64 = 3.072 MHz AND DECIMATE TO\n  16 kHz IN FIRMWARE.\n\nFIRMWARE SAFETY: NEVER REMOVE LRCLK WHILE BCLK\nIS RUNNING - THE AMP CAN PUT DC ON THE SPEAKER."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 340 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "721c5215-e7c4-429c-b381-6062a1551a86")
	)
