		(uuid "55d9d0fd-9539-46cb-8a58-37ce3307ed67")
	)
	(text "SPEAKER - LOCKED FBV2-S1-006\n\nLS1 = PUI AUDIO AS02008MR-LW152-R\n  20 mm DIA x 3 mm, 8R +/-15%,\n  0.5 W RATED / 0.8 W MAX,\n  86 +/-3 dBA @ 0.1 W / 0.1 m,\n  500-4000 Hz  =  VOICE BAND, NOT MUSIC,\n  152 mm UL1571 AWG#32 LEADS, RED +, BLACK -.\n\nOFF-BOARD, ENCLOSURE-MOUNTED, WIRED VIA J6.\nLS1 IS EXCLUDED FROM THE BOARD (on_board no).\nJ6 pin 1 = SPK_P   J6 pin 2 = SPK_N\nMATING: JST PHR-2 + SPH-002T-P0.5S.\nAWG#32 IS INSIDE THE PH RANGE (#32 TO #24),\nSO NO SOLDERING IS NEEDED TO REPLACE IT.\nOBSERVE POLARITY - THE CONE MOVES FORWARD ON\nA POSITIVE VOLTAGE AT THE RED LEAD.\n\nPOWER AT 3.3 V INTO 8R:\n  RAIL LIMIT 2.33 Vrms -> 0.68 W PEAK\n  ~230 mA PEAK FROM +3V3 AT 90% EFFICIENCY\n  DEFAULT MAX SOFTWARE VOLUME -6 dBFS -> 0.17 W,\n  WELL INSIDE THE 0.5 W RATING, ~89 dB @ 0.1 m.\n\nEMI RECOVERY, NOT FITTED BY DEFAULT:\n  R121 / R122  0R FITTED  (PLAIN WIRE)\n  C81 / C82    1nF DNP\nMAX98357A DATA SHEET FIG 14 SHOWS COMPLIANCE\nWITH 12 in OF CABLE AND NO FILTER AT ALL.\nPCB: ROUTE SPK_P / SPK_N AS A TIGHT PAIR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 340 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "14eadc76-8b9e-4bf0-9f6f-7d6db18cbb04")
	)
